{
  "acceptance": "30/30 shots must have semantically matching narration; captions/SFX cannot substitute for speech. Same selected speaker, no unapproved voice switch.",
  "script_characters": 552,
  "duration": 180,
  "review_policy": "ASR evidence and semantic boundary review required; source generation does not mean approval.",
  "shots": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 5,
      "text": "妹妹遇害第二天，他照常去集训。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 13,
      "source_kind": "individual_selected_voice",
      "file": "production/shibuya2006/audio/S01.mp3",
      "sha256": "c2acf7117ab0d814e72dee61986e94813002506eec02d77376ad13be10303984",
      "seconds": 3.528,
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 1.472
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "start": 5,
      "end": 10,
      "text": "他背着行李，走进集合点。家里，究竟发生了什么？",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 19,
      "source_kind": "individual_selected_voice",
      "file": "production/shibuya2006/audio/S02.mp3",
      "sha256": "87743ed00221fca64727e37be3cc94937b564b2db397d1fb9c7418c98bc00ab5",
      "seconds": 6.096,
      "speed_needed": 1.219,
      "natural_tail": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "start": 10,
      "end": 17,
      "text": "时间倒回一天前。东京涩谷，年末的街道依然热闹。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 20,
      "source_kind": "individual_selected_voice",
      "file": "production/shibuya2006/audio/S03.mp3",
      "sha256": "7be71c486b4be32c115a45736c6540256d4a23293622e00962fcd94d7a7ce3b6",
      "seconds": 5.976,
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 1.024
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "start": 17,
      "end": 24,
      "text": "这户人家，父母都是牙科医师。屋里，一切整整齐齐。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 20,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 5.856,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S04.mp3",
      "sha256": "6d0d8394c0307cca368b5329923fca655fefe867eb8aca55c37c56f5cc4ca426",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 1.144
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "start": 24,
      "end": 30,
      "text": "长子读牙科。次子勇贵二十一岁，还在为升学复读。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 20,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 5.52,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S05.mp3",
      "sha256": "6a5c665eb1056678a7ec2394bd0ecb2d9dbdbcf82f7366cd6eb5ffd4ccbd3b04",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 0.48
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "start": 30,
      "end": 35,
      "text": "妹妹亚澄二十岁。读短大，也有自己的梦想。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 17,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 4.272,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S06.mp3",
      "sha256": "d66fa9fe0e802bfe214deb731eeae590cbe581d9fbb5e67d71b24a4469318a75",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 0.728
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "start": 35,
      "end": 42,
      "text": "那天下午，母亲和长子离开家，准备回福岛过年。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 19,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 4.68,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S07.mp3",
      "sha256": "c974eb089f17180927c02fe68805e76c5a54c2237d7b1ab2113eb08037816cad",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 2.32
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "start": 42,
      "end": 49,
      "text": "父亲随后也出了门。门一关，家里只剩兄妹两人。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 19,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 5.088,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S08.mp3",
      "sha256": "8c750b997492d9bf844c6f0e7fce02ffc26bc9fc6898c5041f1d92013c279ecc",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 1.912
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "start": 49,
      "end": 55,
      "text": "据他后来的供述，争执中，妹妹提到了梦想。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 17,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 3.624,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S09.mp3",
      "sha256": "755217bb44bafb58a71157916672912313239e7d866189a37f6c20355a628606",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 2.376
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "start": 55,
      "end": 60,
      "text": "他说，她讲了句，你没有梦想。但这不是施暴的理由。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 20,
      "source_kind": "speech_service_blocked_no_audio"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "start": 60,
      "end": 67,
      "text": "那天下午，亚澄遇害了。此后的平静，才让人难以理解。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 21,
      "source_kind": "speech_service_blocked_no_audio"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "start": 67,
      "end": 74,
      "text": "他关上房门，也把真相留在了屋里。后来，他承认杀害妹妹。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 23,
      "source_kind": "speech_service_blocked_no_audio"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "start": 74,
      "end": 80,
      "text": "可当时，他没有报警。他选择了隐瞒。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 14,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 3.816,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S13.mp3",
      "sha256": "083cb37ff86dd33eac030b750516e530eab710b324d74830c7d172149ab85319",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 2.184
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "start": 80,
      "end": 85,
      "text": "更反常的是，第二天，他还照常出门。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 14,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 3.48,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S14.mp3",
      "sha256": "795cdb87e533b5fa0d3102b5b4a6232fee9018c001de5598737c576a09260fce",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 1.52
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 91,
      "text": "十二月三十一日，他收拾行李，准备去补习班集训。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 20,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 4.296,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S15.mp3",
      "sha256": "a264f6f4603718fd4487a5969ba8aa810e74efb3612a9792e570c45661dcec60",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 1.704
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "start": 91,
      "end": 97,
      "text": "他背起行李，独自走向补习班的集合点。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 16,
      "source_kind": "individual_selected_voice",
      "file": "production/shibuya2006/audio/S16.mp3",
      "sha256": "eac6f21b6247ab5a8e0743fe5a18979c5e42beb044005a1204d8d6b96131b7a3",
      "seconds": 4.008,
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 1.992
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "start": 97,
      "end": 103,
      "text": "集合之后，他随队前往集训。看上去，一切如常。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 18,
      "source_kind": "individual_selected_voice",
      "file": "production/shibuya2006/audio/S17.mp3",
      "sha256": "c6aea954a4c2991df0abb96882c0f2bb2b80741da5295fbe14e31b4f27befe50",
      "seconds": 5.376,
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 0.624
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "start": 103,
      "end": 108,
      "text": "而家里的那扇门，仍紧紧关着。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 12,
      "source_kind": "individual_selected_voice",
      "file": "production/shibuya2006/audio/S18.mp3",
      "sha256": "454d34723aa7914ee70bbd06b6b82b6ce17918623a88e29a5fa027bef2efcc46",
      "seconds": 3.648,
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 1.352
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "start": 108,
      "end": 114,
      "text": "一月二日，家人结束返乡行程，回到了东京的家。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 19,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 4.776,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S19.mp3",
      "sha256": "837846a89c5e5c52815e61cb16a9750d0959a98ff739673b186a715f03e4dd09",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 1.224
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "start": 114,
      "end": 120,
      "text": "可直到三日晚上，母亲才察觉到一股异味。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 17,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 4.176,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S20.mp3",
      "sha256": "097a51f0dcfd05623f1d5ed7db454f96e79e3a56f889c5b3f17ece7709e418d6",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 1.824
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "start": 120,
      "end": 125,
      "text": "她走上三楼，停在儿子的房门前。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 13,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 2.856,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S21.mp3",
      "sha256": "4aed2c500abcbb2e12d4f2a88ca165af2de69b718a21df05e73d754d24f25573",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 2.144
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "start": 125,
      "end": 130,
      "text": "真相就此暴露。次日，警方从集训地带走勇贵。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 18,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 5.208,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S22.mp3",
      "sha256": "53f47538dcbad9158354ebd70fe92eb5334d28a41f400443bcf0453f052dd752",
      "speed_needed": 1.042,
      "natural_tail": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "start": 130,
      "end": 137,
      "text": "他先否认，随后承认杀人。可法庭的争议，才刚刚开始。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 21,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 4.56,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S23.mp3",
      "sha256": "9b0598394aece2891cabf5eb0830419ff7c957525b268ef790cbf297501dac6a",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 2.44
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "start": 137,
      "end": 144,
      "text": "法庭争的，不只是他做了什么，还有当时的责任能力。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 21,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 6.48,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S24.mp3",
      "sha256": "77d7604efd07eb9d41bfb5661527288a1ee48a13981ec35d664b100846851518",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 0.52
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "start": 144,
      "end": 150,
      "text": "辩方主张，事后是另一个人格控制了他。争议，就在这里。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 22,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 6.024,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S25.mp3",
      "sha256": "132cda7db63c9bb63b3f7e3a43c6e0bbbd2ef2738cd2e44b8c5ffd66a9dd8ccf",
      "speed_needed": 1.004,
      "natural_tail": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "start": 150,
      "end": 156,
      "text": "一审七年。杀人有罪，另一项指控因责任能力问题获判无罪。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 24,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 6.552,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S26.mp3",
      "sha256": "674ed28941a0bc6e4c527cba62ddea11eb66c09c71ece18957ec67f1ce5149d7",
      "speed_needed": 1.092,
      "natural_tail": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "start": 156,
      "end": 162,
      "text": "可二审发现，他在侦查时，能具体讲清经过。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 17,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 4.344,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S27.mp3",
      "sha256": "0927042690a2234a715b82cedb19582c1ff124e40a0ffb9ee83203e471c0cf93",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 1.656
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "start": 162,
      "end": 168,
      "text": "失忆鉴定的前提被推翻。两罪成立，改判十二年。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 19,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 5.448,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S28.mp3",
      "sha256": "63b4971bb35bd3506928094f4719f6a0bf5f2881b87b832fd9ed9817e1e1cd08",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 0.552
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "start": 168,
      "end": 174,
      "text": "亚澄的人生，不该被缩成一句话。暴力责任属于施暴者。",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 22,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 5.928,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S29.mp3",
      "sha256": "a125d554f09076974874ac7367dbe52baf51ab806b50d8a96ddb12b51d47d878",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 0.072
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "start": 174,
      "end": 180,
      "text": "一个家，该怎样对待，被认为不成器的孩子？",
      "review": "pending",
      "spoken_characters": 17,
      "source_kind": "pause_cut_candidate_not_approved",
      "seconds": 4.368,
      "file": "work/shibuya2006/audio_candidates/S30.mp3",
      "sha256": "8c37a225d268860abbb36c0d4c8886f26c0110cb027cb6292f223b85069505e6",
      "speed_needed": 1,
      "natural_tail": 1.632
    }
  ]
}
